flowchart TD
    Start["Owner requests an adventure export"] --> Read["Read template-owned avatar, scenes, entities and authored settings"]
    Read --> Manifest["Build canonical ADV envelope, format 1.3"]
    Manifest --> Kind{"Requested output"}
    Kind -->|ADV| Json["Return JSON with image references"]
    Kind -->|ADZ| Localize["Localize eligible referenced images using the asset policy"]
    Localize --> Pack["Write adventure.adv and referenced assets into ZIP"]
    Pack --> Download["Return ADZ download"]
    Json --> Done["Read-only transfer complete"]
    Download --> Done
    Manifest -.-> Scope["Session history, private notebooks and live World Info use a separate session transfer"]
    Manifest -->|"Original-project copy"| Convert["Run compatibility and public-content checks"]
    Convert --> Report{"Compatible and required changes acknowledged?"}
    Report -->|Yes| Public["Return a compatible local ADZ copy"]
    Report -->|No| Review["Report unsupported behavior or required review"]
    Public --> Done
    Public -.-> Publish["Online publication is a separate user action"]
